      "name": "Kelly Ayotte",
      "party": "Republican",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Kelly Ayotte is the 83rd Governor of New Hampshire, first elected in 2024. She previously served as a U.S. Senator from New Hampshire (2011\u20132017) and as New Hampshire Attorney General (2004\u20132009), and is running for a second two-year term. Ayotte has focused on law-and-order issues, tightening bail laws and restoring retirement benefits for law enforcement, while also vetoing a bill that would have allowed some spaces to segregate based on biological sex.",
