      "party": "Democratic",
      "incumbent": false,
      "summary": "Cinde Warmington is a former New Hampshire Executive Councilor (2021\u20132025) and the presumptive Democratic nominee for governor in 2026. A healthcare attorney with 40 years of experience in laboratory medicine, hospital management, and healthcare regulatory law, she previously ran for governor in the 2024 Democratic primary, finishing second. Warmington has focused her campaign on affordability, public education, healthcare access, and standing up to the Trump administration's policies.",
