      "party": "Independent",
      "incumbent": false,
      "summary": "Jon Kiper is a former Newmarket Town Councilor, small business owner, and community activist running for governor as an Independent under the newly-formed Community First Party. He previously ran in the 2024 Democratic gubernatorial primary, finishing third with approximately 9% of the vote. Kiper initially launched his 2026 campaign as an independent, briefly entered the Democratic primary, and then reversed course to run as an independent, focusing on property tax reform, affordable housing, and education funding.",
